-- c001-v009: ve-khud kyonki –ke-baare-mein hamaare bataate-hain kaisa pravesh paaya –ki-or tumhaare aur kaise phire –ki-or –ke Parameshwar –se –ki moortiyon seva–karne Parameshwar jeevit aur sachche
-- c001-v010: aur pratikshaa–karne –ke Putra unke –se –ke aakaashon jise uthaaya –se –ke mriton Yeshu –ko bachane-waale humein –se –ke krodh –ke aane-waale
-- c002-v001: Tum-khud kyonki jaante-ho bhaiyo –ko pravesh hamaara –ko –ki-or tumhaare ki nahin vyarth hua
-- c002-v002: balki pehle–dukh-utha-kar aur apamaan–sah-kar jaise jaante-ho –mein Philippoi saahas–kiya –mein –ke Parameshwar hamaare bolne –ki-or tumhaare –ko susmaachaar –ka Parameshwar –mein bahut sangharsh
